amonite-welcome (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show actions only when their capabilities are available.
  * Add --help, --version, and --capabilities to the launcher.
  * Fix terminal updates through the alternatives-selected terminal.
  * Remove the unsupported graphical package-manager action.
  * Fix accessible heading roles.
  * Align provider and packaging metadata with the installed system.

